@startuml
title UML state machine diagram

[*] --> Homepage
Homepage --> Navigation : navigation bar is displayed
Navigation --> ProjectInfo : project information is selected
ProjectInfo --> PhotosOrVideos : user chooses between photos or videos
PhotosOrVideos --> [*]
CareerOpportunities --> UpdateOrApplicationForm : user chooses between viewing updates or opening an application form
UpdateOrApplicationForm --> Checked : submitted job applications are checked (new transition)
Checked --> Logout : after checking, users can log out (new state and transition)
Logout --> [*]
@enduml
